```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "take a carried place back off the carriage board"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.place.uncarries", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.place.uncarries"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.place.uncarries"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.place.uncarries ~ a place leaves the carriage

`lares nexus uncarry <place-key>` takes a carried place back off the carriage board under the quorum; `--out` and `--from` carry a partial between vaults.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ uncarry

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`uncarry` params=`nym/<place-key> ~ uncarry a place`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ nym · nexus · out · from

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nym` params=`takes/key seat/1 as/<place-key> ~ the place's vessel key`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus, by AID; absent, the primary charter's`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`out` params=`takes/host-path ~ write the partial for the next vault`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`from` params=`takes/host-path ~ judge and cosign a partial another vault wrote`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ quorum

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`quorum` params=`who/hand key/seat ~ the founding-kahu quorum signs`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.place.uncarries nym/<place-key>]] ~ no place key named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ uncarried

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`uncarried` params=`exit/0 ~ the uncarry landed`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares nexus uncarry

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares nexus uncarry]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

